(Japanese: '''大山''' ''Ōyama'') is a minor character who appeared in ''[[M07|Destiny Deoxys]]''. He is an attendant working at the [[Battle Tower]] in [[LaRousse City]], whose duties include welcoming challengers and directing them to the battlefield. He was not given an official name in the English [[dub]].

When {{Ash}} came to the Battle Tower to battle [[Rafe]], Ōyama mistakenly thought [[Tory Lund|Tory]], who was actually afraid of Pokémon, wanted to battle as well. He pushed him and Ash to the registration area and wished them good luck with their {{pkmn|battle}}.

